<title>UK: UK money market forecasts 600 mln stg shortage.</title>
<headline>UK money market forecasts 600 mln stg shortage.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average of forecasts by UK money market brokers of Tuesday's market shortage is 600 million stg, according to a Reuter market survey.</p>
<p>The official forecast for the shortage will be released by the Bank of England at between 0945 GMT and 1000 GMT.</p>
<p>Monday's final shortage was 650 million stg.</p>
</text>
